# Manas-branch-only: the frontend is being rewritten end-to-end.
# Untracked on this branch so Mihir's pull never carries the new
# frontend across to main. Mihir's existing local files stay on
# disk (they're just untracked now), the placeholder frontend in
# main keeps shipping, and the docker frontend service continues
# to run the legacy code without ever seeing the rewrite.
frontend/
